## 8. Show null handling for optional structures

```sql
SELECT
    COUNT(*) AS total_contacts,
    SUM(CASE WHEN agent_arn IS NULL THEN 1 ELSE 0 END)
        AS contacts_without_agent,
    SUM(CASE WHEN queue_arn IS NULL THEN 1 ELSE 0 END)
        AS contacts_without_queue,
    SUM(
        CASE
            WHEN agent_arn IS NULL AND queue_arn IS NULL
            THEN 1 ELSE 0
        END
    ) AS contacts_without_agent_or_queue
FROM public.ctr_flattened;
```

Explain:

> “Agent and Queue are optional for some contact types. The job retains those contacts and safely represents unavailable structures as null instead of dropping the record.”

