## Recommended demo order

Run:

1. Table coverage.
2. Main validation.
3. Duplicate check.
4. Latest-version selection.
5. Flattened field sample.
6. Null-handling summary.
7. Mismatch details only if the main validation reports mismatches.

That tells the story without getting stuck in too many separate checks.



